{
 "encounter_id": "00642",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hi! Sorry, I'm a bit early, I didn't want to get stuck in traffic and then I was parked in the first space I saw. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Early is fine. Come in, Maya. It's six weeks since we started the antidepressant, so I'd like to hear how it's been."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Honestly? Better, a bit better. Not fixed, but better. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me what's better and what's still hard. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm crying less, which my sister has noticed. But I'm still waking at four every morning, and I can't get back to sleep."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Four every morning, and then you lie awake?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, my mind starts going over work, and by seven I'm shattered."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any side effects from the tablets, anything you've noticed since starting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm sweating more at night, which is a bit gross, and it makes the waking worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Now I have to ask: any thoughts of harming yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Not at all. That was never, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any panic attacks, or racing heart?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any dizziness, especially standing up?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No dizziness. I did feel strange in the first week, but that's gone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Tell me what you're taking, to check it matches the record."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sertraline, 100 mg once a day, in the morning. And mirtazapine, 15 mg at night, which I started with the sertraline."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. And any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No known allergies, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And in terms of other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Depression, obviously, first diagnosed at nineteen. And I get migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just my tonsils, when I was six."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I've got the trolley, doctor. Shall I do Maya's observations while you finish typing? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please, Nurse Amy. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Blood pressure 116 over 72, pulse 74, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, weight 63 kilos.",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is my weight okay? I've had a bit less appetite. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's stable, so that's good. I'll check your pulse and look for a tremor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse is regular, and no tremor in your hands.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's what I wanted. So, thinking about it all, this looks like depression that's partly responding to treatment, so I'm not changing the antidepressant today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And the sleep? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The early waking is a common thing in depression. But I can't rule out an underactive thyroid contributing, so I'd like to check that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a thyroid blood test, and a sodium level, as the sertraline can lower sodium."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can take those bloods now, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please, Amy. And since you're on two medicines that can affect the heart rhythm, I'd also like an ECG while you're here."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is something wrong with my heart? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, it's a precaution, and it takes two minutes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you in four weeks to go over the results and see how the sleep is."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
